Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.45,0:01:04.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:04.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.75,0:01:06.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要去上厕所了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:06.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm going on my bathroom break
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,限时十五秒  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got 15 seconds, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些白痴甚至都没注意到我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The fools didn't even notice me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.52,0:01:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.89,0:01:25.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把这些面包都放进冰库里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:25.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Put these buns in the freezer
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免得它们更不新鲜了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before they go more stale
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我的休息时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What about my break?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想歇我就让你歇菜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:31.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give ya a break
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.91,0:01:46.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:46.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.25,0:01:52.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有人忘关冰库了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:52.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Somebody left the freezer open
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又被他锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He locked it again
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.55,0:02:01.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:01.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面还有人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Someone's in here
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:06.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎收听交际石头滩语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:06.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Conversational Rock Bottomese
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请跟我念
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:08.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repeat after me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪里有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最近的图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:13.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,nearest library?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.90,0:02:15.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪里有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.90,0:02:15.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where is the
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.44,0:02:17.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最近的图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:17.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,nearest library?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来也没得选了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess there's no choice
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干嘛脱衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking your clothes off?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不能把衣服弄皱了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't want them to get wrinkled
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.80,0:02:39.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:39.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the name of plutonium-238?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.09,0:02:45.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是跟你说了我在里面时别锁冰库吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.09,0:02:41.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:45.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about locking the freezer when I'm inside
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.35,0:02:47.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都不知道今天是便装星期五
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.35,0:02:47.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was casual Friday
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.81,0:02:49.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真对不起  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:49.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.35,0:02:52.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我居然会把我最好的朋友锁在冰库里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:52.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I locked my best friend in the freezer
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.86,0:02:56.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟你说过了  我们不是最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.86,0:02:56.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've told you before, we're not best friends
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.15,0:02:59.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那笑话一次比一次好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:59.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That joke gets funnier every time
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.79,0:03:15.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么钻过门底下的空子的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:15.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you squeeze under the door?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.30,0:03:21.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们章鱼再小的空子都钻得过去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:21.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We octopi can squeeze through the smallest of gaps
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.30,0:03:26.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我想到了个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:26.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's given me an idea for a
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝妙的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:30.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,brilliant plan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.64,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(498,674)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很不想问  但这是在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask, but what are we doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.27,0:03:36.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很简单  凯伦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:36.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's simple, Karen
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.77,0:03:39.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,首先我会跟章鱼哥交换身体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:39.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, I'll swap bodies with Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后溜进老螃蟹的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.11,0:03:40.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then I'll sneak into Krabs' office
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.99,0:03:44.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,钻进保险箱  偷走秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:44.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,squeeze inside the safe, and steal the secret formula
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全都要感谢我新发明的大脑交换器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to my new brain switcher
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竖笛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A clarinet?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  那是个伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's camouflage
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.12,0:03:54.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用来把那个白痴骗进我的陷阱里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:54.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to lure that simpleton into my trap
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,献给章鱼哥  你的头号粉丝寄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.55,0:04:04.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"To Squidward, from your biggest fan"?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.80,0:04:09.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于有人认可我的惊世才华了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:09.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, someone recognizes my staggering talent
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个计划万无一失
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This plan is foolproof
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.16,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1088,920)}白 痴 证 明
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.61,0:04:25.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:25.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,证明你是个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Proof that you're a fool
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,适应这具身体还真得费点工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:34.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This body takes some getting used to
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.25,0:04:35.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四条腿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:35.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Four legs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,几十个吸盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.46,0:04:38.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,dozens of suction cups
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最糟的是两只眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:40.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and worst of all two eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.80,0:04:47.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:47.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没见过章鱼走路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've never seen an octopus walk before?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我正走着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm walkin' here
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你快没新鲜海水了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're running out of fresh water
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.36,0:05:03.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:03.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.61,0:05:04.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:04.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,By the way
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.07,0:05:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我怎么会在痞老板的身体里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:07.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what am I doing in Plankton's body?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.74,0:05:13.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这只是他又一个偷蟹黄堡秘方的诡计
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just another one of his schemes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:13.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to steal the Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.00,0:05:16.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  我确定他的计划很快就会失败
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:16.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm sure his plan will fail in no time
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.50,0:05:20.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟演奏这个专辑的合成器约过会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:20.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I used to date the synthesizer on this album
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.55,0:05:24.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是科达创1128xr啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:24.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good ol' 1128xr chordatron
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.13,0:05:28.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你也喜欢电子爵士乐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:28.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You like electro-jazz, too?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我特爱听哔博普爵士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I adore beep bop
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从容点  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Play it cool, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.77,0:05:44.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要钻进保险柜  秘方就到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is squeeze into the safe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:44.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and that formula is yours
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不费吹灰之力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All too easy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.83,0:05:51.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:51.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plank--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绝对是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Definitely Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.87,0:05:58.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.87,0:05:58.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饿肚子的客人们还在等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hungry customers are waiting
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不把他们餐点端出来就不准走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you ain't leaving until they've all been served
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.50,0:06:04.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:04.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Curses
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.59,0:06:09.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就爱这个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:09.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I love this one
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.22,0:06:14.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能感受到绝望的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:14.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can really sense the despair
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is it possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.10,0:06:19.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,难道我终于找到知音
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:19.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have I finally found a kindred spirit
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,分享我对艺术的热爱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to share my love of art?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.19,0:06:25.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然你鼻子至少有画上的两倍大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:25.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Although your nose is at least twice that size
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,结果答案是并没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the answer is no
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.28,0:06:32.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝不会傻坐在这被烤面包机侮辱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna sit around here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and be insulted by a toaster oven
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.20,0:06:38.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我又想了下  是有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:38.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,On second thought, it is a little
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,缺乏创意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,derivative
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.55,0:06:49.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要抢回我身体  什么都拦不住我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:49.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm getting my body back and nothing's getting in my way
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.84,0:06:51.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走路小心看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:51.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来午餐高峰结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:01.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like the lunch rush is over
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, best friend
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.11,0:07:07.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从我身上下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:07.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get off of me
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.24,0:07:12.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要怎么甩掉那个方形白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:12.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I going to ditch that boxy buffoon?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.03,0:07:16.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是个难题  不过我现在能点午餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:16.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a real stumper, but can I order lunch now?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然不能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clearly not
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm busy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.08,0:07:23.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想念我吗  最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:23.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you miss me, best friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.25,0:07:24.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很想念你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:24.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I missed you
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scram
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.59,0:07:32.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说  我们应该玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:32.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean we should play hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好的朋友都玩这游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A game all best friends play
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:36.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd love to
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且我知道要躲哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I know just where to hide
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,呆头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blockhead
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是半毛钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:48.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that a nickel?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,白送的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Free money?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要两份蟹黄堡  油多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like two Krabby Patties, extra grease
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份海草汽水  不用杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a kelp soda, no cup
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总算到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:10.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我站住  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以为自己能直接滚进来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You think you can just roll right in, do ya?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢海神王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:17.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我不是痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I'm not Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你肯定绝望到不顾一切了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:23.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must be desperate, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,竟然以为我会上当
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if you think I'm falling for that one
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.44,0:08:27.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:27.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward's right over there
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还醒着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.69,0:08:31.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:31.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at him
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一点活都不干
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's not doing a lick of work
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那才是真正的章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the real Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快滚出我的餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now get outta me restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't understand
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.29,0:08:43.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板偷了我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:43.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton stole my body
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that works
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够不到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't reach it
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这身体太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This body's too big
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许要是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:10.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.61,0:09:12.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只能带走整个瓶子了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:12.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have to take the whole bottle
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.74,0:09:17.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我被困住了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:17.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trapped
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.88,标准-Chi,,0,800,0,,好了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.88,标准-Eng,,0,800,0,,Alright, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.09,标准-Chi,,0,800,0,,快把我身体还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.09,标准-Eng,,0,800,0,,You're gonna give me my body back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.55,标准-Chi,,0,800,0,,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.55,标准-Eng,,0,800,0,,Right now
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.13,标准-Chi,,0,800,0,,求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.13,标准-Eng,,0,800,0,,I'd love to
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.13,0:09:36.80,标准-Chi,,0,800,0,,快救我出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:36.80,标准-Eng,,0,800,0,,Just get me out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.01,0:09:39.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:39.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.35,0:09:45.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How did you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.31,0:09:49.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以原来我自己就可以钻进保险柜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:49.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean I could have squeezed into the safe all along?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.40,0:09:49.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:49.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.98,0:09:53.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是得把你粉身碎骨才进得去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:53.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just had to break every bone in your body to get inside
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再用力推啊  你这傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Push harder, you fool
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等  我去找点油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:59.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I'll get some grease
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.99,0:10:03.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下可好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:03.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也被困住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:05.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm stuck too
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,几小时后
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:16.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the mizzenmast is going on in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.18,0:10:19.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:19.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板偷了我的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:22.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton stole my body
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只想知道你们两个干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:26.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just want to know what you two were doing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.43,0:10:28.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我的假保险柜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:28.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in me dummy safe
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我的假办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in me dummy office
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我的假蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in me dummy Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我的假裤头村
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in me dummy Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.36,0:10:41.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿着我的假秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:41.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,holding me dummy formula
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.41,0:10:44.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,假秘方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:44.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dummy formula?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.04,0:10:48.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:48.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton is a dummy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:48.83,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1088,920)}假 的
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.71,0:10:53.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下次好运
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:53.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better luck next time
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.71,0:10:56.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闹够了没
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:56.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are we done here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.21,0:11:00.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来帮你们换回各自的身体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:11:00.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get you guys back into your own bodies
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.59,0:11:02.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:02.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.43,0:11:03.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吹一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:03.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give it a toot
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.69,0:11:15.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你晚上最好睁一只眼柄睡觉  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:15.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You better sleep with one eyestalk open, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会搞到你秘方的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get your formula
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定会的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是回家去吧  猛男
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go home, tiger
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.32,0:11:23.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你泡一杯热可可
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:23.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll make you a nice cup of hot cocoa
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有加小小的棉花糖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:25.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With little bitty marshmallows?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有加小小的棉花糖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With little bitty marshmallows
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.83,0:11:29.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:29.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.75,0:11:30.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果不其然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:30.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Typical
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他肯定找不到我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's never gonna find me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:42.72,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp40\c&H00FFC1&}西部蠢笨史
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:44.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(752,430)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:44.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(770,722)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:48.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1530,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(636,484)}指导总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(800,700)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:47.01,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(760,550)}制片
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:48.47,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(596,560)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(640,598)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, partner
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.66,0:12:08.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:08.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快快过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:15.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yippee heigh ho, ki-yay
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别激动  小蜗牛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy there, little snaily
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,驾  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Giddyup, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.59,0:12:22.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:22.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ride 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来小蜗不想当马
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.73,0:12:35.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess Gary doesn't want to play horsey
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.77,0:12:36.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:36.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's okay
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.11,0:12:41.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道可以去哪尽情体验狂野西部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:41.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know just where to go to get my Wild West on
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.15,0:12:46.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会绕着树屋而来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:46.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be comin' round the tree dome when I come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:46.03,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自民谣《她会翻山越岭而来》 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.62,0:12:48.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:48.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.49,0:12:51.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要组建一支搜捕队  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:51.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'mma puttin' together a posse, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.25,0:12:54.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这镇上有几个偷橡子的贼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:54.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got acorn rustlers in town
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.54,0:12:57.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,偷橡子的贼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:57.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Acorn rustlers?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.88,0:12:58.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.88,0:12:58.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.59,0:12:59.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要逮着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:12:59.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lemme at 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好笑了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very funny, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.80,0:13:09.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我从不开橡子的玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:09.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I don't joke about acorns
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.18,0:13:11.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatcha doin' here?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.68,0:13:14.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以教我当个真正的牛仔吗  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:14.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you teach me how to be a real cowboy, Sandy?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.52,0:13:15.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:15.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.23,0:13:17.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看起来很好玩的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:17.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It looks like a heap of fun
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.35,0:13:18.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:18.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure I can
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.52,0:13:20.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先来个摸底测试
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:20.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First, let's see what you already know
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.23,0:13:22.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你会吐口水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:22.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you spit?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.66,0:13:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,待会儿再练那个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll work on that
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.87,0:13:33.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我看看你的八字胡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:33.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, now show me your mustache
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:37.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.42,0:13:40.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胡子上已经沾满了豆子  可以加分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:40.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And extra points for already having beans in it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:40.50,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 焗豆子是牛仔常吃的食物 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well golly, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你差不多已经可以当牛仔了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's just about all there is to being a cowboy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.89,0:13:51.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只差马术了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:51.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only thing left to cover is horsemanship
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.18,0:13:53.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好我刚把满天星修好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:53.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing I just finished repairing Sparky
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真乖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good boy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这边有匹泡泡野马
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.53,0:14:09.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I have a bubbly bronco right here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.37,0:14:14.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想让马跑起来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:14.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To get your horse going
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就要给马发令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just give 'em a little "giddyup"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,麻烦驾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Giddyup, please
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.17,0:14:27.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡泡靴子没法让马跑起来  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those bubble boots ain't gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,get your horse movin', SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.17,0:14:28.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得加上马刺才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:28.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You need spurs
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我剩的泡泡水刚好够用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:32.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have just enough bubble soap left
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.39,0:14:40.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吁  泡泡小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:40.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, bubble fella
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真帅气  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lookin' good, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你准备好开启真正的牛仔冒险了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you're ready for a real cowboy adventure
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.73,0:14:46.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好说  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:46.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.99,0:14:48.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一把马扎破怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:48.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if I pop my pony?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.65,0:14:50.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我泡泡水都用光了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:50.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm all out of bubble soap
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不成问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ain't a problem
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.66,0:14:54.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给满天星装备了泡泡嗅探器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:54.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I outfitted Sparky here with a bubble sniffer
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一路上可以找到更多泡泡水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can hunt down more on the way
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最最牛仔的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothin' more cowboy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然就是长途跋涉寻找财富
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,than riding out in search of your fortune
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,财富
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fortune?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.13,0:15:08.30,标准-Chi,,0,900,0,,想象一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:08.30,标准-Eng,,0,900,0,,Just imagine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.80,标准-Chi,,0,900,0,,那堆财富都会归我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.80,标准-Eng,,0,900,0,,all that treasure could be mine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.80,0:15:11.89,标准-Chi,,0,900,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:11.89,标准-Eng,,0,900,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.89,0:15:14.22,标准-Chi,,0,900,0,,你这吹泡泡的就发了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:14.22,标准-Eng,,0,900,0,,You'll be one wealthy bubble blower
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,财富
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fortune?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Treasure?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wealth?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.10,0:15:21.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该全都归我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:21.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That should all be mine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我真应该要抢占他们的寻宝权吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But should I really jump their claim?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然应该了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course I should
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位老哥要当亡命徒了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This dude's going desperado
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.28,0:15:32.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好我还有珍珍以前的玩具竹马
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:32.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing I still have Pearl's old hobby horse
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,满天星嗅到气味了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:48.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sparky's picked up the scent
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.47,0:15:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh boy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.60,0:16:01.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这条溪流一看就可以找到泡泡水
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:59.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This stream looks like the perfect place
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:01.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to find bubble soap
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中奖了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jackpot
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得把这些烦人的金块丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just have to get these pesky gold nuggets out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.61,0:16:11.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下  搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:11.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on there, partner
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉煞了你的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to burst your bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:12.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1156,920)}泡 泡
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些有可能是  愚人泡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:14.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but these might be "fool's bubbles"
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.28,0:16:17.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:17.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.95,0:16:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aw, nurtz
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:24.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, our hunt continues
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄黄黄  黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,G-g-g-gold?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.38,0:16:33.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然海绵宝宝连这都要丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:33.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If SpongeBob's throwing this away
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想象一下他留的是什么宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:35.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,imagine what he's keeping
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.97,0:16:39.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老爹就喜欢这样的甜头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:39.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of sugar papa likes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再稍微
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a little
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:49.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,further
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.70,0:16:59.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:16:59.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.91,0:17:02.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对哦  飞起来更容易
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:02.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, flying is easier
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定就是这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This must be the place
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  满天星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sparky
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.43,0:17:19.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来淘宝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:19.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now let's get to work
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.10,0:17:26.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't get it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,泡泡水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are all the bubbles?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.66,0:17:40.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:40.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Barnacles
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又是黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just more gold
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.87,0:17:45.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一定是挖到泡泡矿脉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You musta hit the bubblelode
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:17:59.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gold
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.06,0:18:12.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比蟹黄堡还要美味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.06,0:18:12.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tastes even better than a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两到五天后拉出来再见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in two to five days
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.62,0:18:22.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然天黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:22.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that the day's done
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.20,0:18:23.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就来扎营过夜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:23.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it's time to make camp for the night
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就像真的牛仔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just like real cowboys?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.29,0:18:27.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:27.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.31,0:18:49.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The treasure
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.65,0:18:53.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牛仔露营配个牛仔歌才完整
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And no cowboy camp-out is complete
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,without a little cowboy song
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Goody
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成为一名牛仔  打招呼不用你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:00.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When you're a cowboy, you don't say "hello, boy"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.28,0:19:02.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要脱帽说贵安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:02.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You tip your hat and say "how do?"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.53,0:19:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上班不要开车去  那样看着就傻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't drive to work, 'cause you'd look like a jerk
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.87,0:19:07.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牛仔就该骑马
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:07.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ride a galloping horse, buckaroo
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.20,0:19:09.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不看电视  不盯电子屏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:09.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no watching TV or looking at screen-ies
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.83,0:19:12.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牛仔会嫌那样很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.83,0:19:12.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A cowboy would find that stuff strange
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,劳动一整天  晚上来入眠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They work all the day and then hit the hay
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.59,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1226,920)}打 干 草
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在梦乡里骑马巡逻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And dream about riding the range
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.55,0:19:19.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牛仔唱着牛仔歌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.55,0:19:19.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, cowboys sing about cowboys
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.26,0:19:21.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,待到白天的牛仔生活结束
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:21.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When the cowboying day is all done
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为牛仔就是牛仔  而如果当上牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Cause cowboys are cowboys and if you're a cowboy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其他一切乐趣都比不上它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then nothing else seems quite as fun
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.52,0:19:29.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牛仔就是牛仔  而如果当上牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:29.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, cowboys are cowboys, and if you're a cowboy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其他一切乐趣都比不上它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then nothing else seems quite as fun
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.98,0:19:35.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚安  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:35.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Night, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.61,0:19:43.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,黄金黄金黄金黄金
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:43.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gold, gold, gold, gold
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还以为黄金会重一点呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:47.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thought the gold would be heavier
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.16,0:19:50.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没想到我这么有力气
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:50.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess I don't know my own strength
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的豆子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My beans
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别管豆子了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget the beans, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们被伏击了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:10.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We've been bushwhacked
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.77,0:20:11.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:11.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.60,0:20:17.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,玩具竹马  出发
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:17.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heigh ho, hobby horse, away
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.36,0:20:19.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:19.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快  上马鞍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quick, saddle up
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.24,0:20:22.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:22.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no
Dialogue: 1,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,满天星没电了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sparky's done lost his spark
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的泡泡马也飘走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And my bubble bronc is bobbing away
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, partner
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,牛仔总是有备用计划
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A cowboy always has a backup plan
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,启动手动模式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Activate manual mode
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓住那个坏蛋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get that varmint
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:54.60,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1126,918)}温泉
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enough playing around
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.36,0:21:48.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到此为止了  尤金
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:48.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line, Eugene
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.95,0:21:50.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宝藏是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.95,0:21:50.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The treasure's mine
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.41,0:21:51.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:51.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All mine
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.49,0:21:52.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都不能从我身上夺走
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:52.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No one can take it from me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.08,0:21:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我看你一眼  我亮晶晶的宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me see you, my shiny beauties
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.67,0:22:01.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  千万不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:01.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, don't do it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.94,0:22:25.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很遗憾你的泡泡都没了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:25.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout your bubbles, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.07,0:22:26.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.07,0:22:26.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.99,0:22:31.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真正的泡泡是我们一路上骑马的牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.99,0:22:28.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The real bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:31.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are the cowboys we bronco'ed along the way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.99,0:22:31.99,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 改自“真正的宝藏是你一路上交的朋友” ]
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.08,0:22:36.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  那句话一点逻辑也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.08,0:22:36.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, that don't make a lick of sense
